<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Flesh Catastrophe -->
  <FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.label>血肉灾变</FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.label>
  <!-- EN: The once-impenetrable anomalous research facility was consumed by a spreading wave of flesh. You survived only because you were outside when it happened. While searching the remains of the guard detail, you found another survivor. She claims to be a senior researcher from the laboratory, and more terrifyingly, she seems able to command the fleshbeasts at will. You gather essential supplies from the edge of the facility and leave the flesh hell behind. -->
  <FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.description>曾经坚不可摧的异象实验基地已被蔓延的血肉浪潮吞噬，而你侥幸在外躲过一劫。当你在守备部队的尸骸中搜寻时，发现了另一名幸存者。她自称是实验室的高级研究员，更令人畏惧的是，她似乎可以自如地操控那些狰狞的血肉兽。你们收集了基地外围的必要物资，离开了这座血肉地狱。</FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.description>
  <!-- EN: The once-impenetrable anomalous research facility was consumed by a spreading wave of flesh. You survived only because you were outside when it happened. While searching the remains of the guard detail, you found another survivor. She claims to be a senior researcher from the laboratory, and more terrifyingly, she seems able to command the fleshbeasts at will. You gather essential supplies from the edge of the facility and leave the flesh hell behind. -->
  <FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.scenario.description>曾经坚不可摧的异象实验基地已被蔓延的血肉浪潮吞噬，而你侥幸在外躲过一劫。当你在守备部队的尸骸中搜寻时，发现了另一名幸存者。她自称是实验室的高级研究员，更令人畏惧的是，她似乎可以自如地操控那些狰狞的血肉兽。你们收集了基地外围的必要物资，离开了这座血肉地狱。</FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.scenario.description>
  <!-- EN: Flesh Catastrophe -->
  <FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.scenario.name>血肉灾变</FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.scenario.name>
  <!-- EN: The surviving researcher appears to be hiding something. She carries a fleshbeast core and claims that its power can be used to establish a controlled fleshbeast hive. It is an absurd idea, but in the sparsely inhabited wilderness of the rim, it may be the only way forward. -->
  <FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.scenario.parts.GameStartDialog.text>幸存的研究员似乎隐瞒了一些信息。她携带着某种血肉兽核心，并声称可以利用这股力量建立一个受控的血肉兽巢群。多么荒诞的设想，但是在这个人烟稀少的边缘世界荒野，似乎也只能如此了。</FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.scenario.parts.GameStartDialog.text>
  <!-- EN: Start with one colonist, one special character, and several fleshbeast servants. -->
  <FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.scenario.parts.ConfigurePawnsMutants.customSummary>以一名殖民者与一名特殊角色以及几个血肉兽仆从开局</FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.scenario.parts.ConfigurePawnsMutants.customSummary>
  <!-- EN: Start with one colonist, one special character, and several fleshbeast servants. -->
  <FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.scenario.summary>以一名殖民者与一名特殊角色以及几个血肉兽仆从开局</FH_FleshCatastropheSurvivors.scenario.summary>
  
</LanguageData>